WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.788 --> 00:00:13.997
"I need to to Gem's Jewelry," Roxy thought.

2
00:00:14.017 --> 00:00:17.280
"I have to find out why things are disappearing."

3
00:00:18.261 --> 00:00:20.082
Mara was far ahead in the race by now.

4
00:00:20.763 --> 00:00:22.564
But Terrell and Jack were running slowly.

5
00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:32.252
guys." Roxy pretended to breathe hard.

6
00:00:34.376 --> 00:00:35.497
"Whew! I'm out of breath.

7
00:00:35.577 --> 00:00:38.479
I—um, I need to walk for a—a bit."

8
00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:40.661
Jack slowed down.

9
00:00:40.681 --> 00:00:42.162
"Oh, good!"

10
00:00:42.743 --> 00:00:44.144
He was still gasping for air.

11
00:00:44.164 --> 00:00:46.366
"I'll walk with you."

12
00:00:46.386 --> 00:00:48.908
"Uh-oh," Roxy thought.

13
00:00:48.928 --> 00:00:51.350
"I can't leave if Jack is with me."

14
00:00:52.511 --> 00:00:53.952
Terrell gave Roxy a quick look.

15
00:00:54.653 --> 00:00:56.014
Then he started to run faster.

16
00:00:56.034 --> 00:00:57.695
"Hey, Jack!"

17
00:00:57.995 --> 00:00:58.996
he called over his shoulder.

18
00:00:59.016 --> 00:01:00.998
"I'm going to beat you!"

19
00:01:01.018 --> 00:01:03.500
"No way!"

20
00:01:03.864 --> 00:01:04.524
Jack cried.

21
00:01:05.165 --> 00:01:06.325
He hurried after Terrell.

22
00:01:06.365 --> 00:01:09.706
"Thanks, Terrell," Roxy thought.

23
00:01:11.067 --> 00:01:13.288
Seconds later Roxy arrived at Gem's Jewelry.

24
00:01:14.468 --> 00:01:15.889
Detective Smith was already there.

25
00:01:16.729 --> 00:01:18.550
Gem stood behind an empty jewelry case.

26
00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:21.271
"Hey, Detective!"

27
00:01:21.611 --> 00:01:22.392
Roxy smiled.

28
00:01:23.252 --> 00:01:26.814
"Are you here to buy something for your sweetheart?"

29
00:01:28.574 --> 00:01:30.055
Detective Smith turned red.

30
00:01:30.075 --> 00:01:34.229
"Actually, um Roxy gasped.

31
00:01:34.949 --> 00:01:36.550
"You are?

32
00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:38.291
I was just kidding."

33
00:01:39.131 --> 00:01:40.332
Detective Smith sighed.

34
00:01:41.252 --> 00:01:43.414
"Yes, Rocket Girl.

35
00:01:43.614 --> 00:01:45.955
I was here to buy a necklace for someone.

36
00:01:47.216 --> 00:01:49.817
But then all the jewelry in the store disappeared."

37
00:01:51.678 --> 00:01:52.299
Gem nodded.

38
00:01:52.319 --> 00:01:54.640
"It was so strange.

39
00:01:56.201 --> 00:01:59.783
One moment all of my jewelry cases were full.

40
00:02:00.363 --> 00:02:01.844
The next moment, poof!

41
00:02:02.764 --> 00:02:03.384
They were empty."

42
00:02:05.125 --> 00:02:05.765
She frowned.

43
00:02:05.785 --> 00:02:09.246
"I hope you can find my jewelry."

44
00:02:09.266 --> 00:02:12.227
"Did you see anything odd?"

45
00:02:12.547 --> 00:02:13.227
Roxy asked.

46
00:02:14.107 --> 00:02:17.008
"Did anything happen before the jewelry vanished?"

47
00:02:18.228 --> 00:02:19.268
Detective Smith nodded.

48
00:02:19.288 --> 00:02:22.249
"Something seemed to move through the store.

49
00:02:22.929 --> 00:02:23.990
But it was so fast.

50
00:02:24.230 --> 00:02:25.330
We couldn't see what it was."

51
00:02:25.350 --> 00:02:29.931
"It was like a strong wind blowing through here."

52
00:02:30.812 --> 00:02:31.952
Gem threw up her arms.

53
00:02:32.876 --> 00:02:36.018
"Whoosh!" Roxy rubbed her chin.

54
00:02:36.038 --> 00:02:39.981
"Mayor Bloom said people called about other things vanishing."

55
00:02:40.001 --> 00:02:43.183
"Yes," Detective Smith said.

56
00:02:43.203 --> 00:02:46.326
"And it all happened in the last ten minutes.

57
00:02:47.707 --> 00:02:50.649
The first call came from two Shopwell Supermarket workers.

58
00:02:51.429 --> 00:02:53.471
They were carrying money, but it disappeared."

59
00:02:53.491 --> 00:02:56.413
"Wow," Roxy said.

60
00:02:56.433 --> 00:03:00.616
"If these are robberies, the thief is really fast!"

61
00:03:01.344 --> 00:03:02.685
Detective Smith's phone beeped.

62
00:03:02.705 --> 00:03:05.527
"Hello? Oh no!

63
00:03:06.027 --> 00:03:07.268
Okay, we'll check it out."

64
00:03:07.949 --> 00:03:08.829
He looked at Roxy.

65
00:03:09.530 --> 00:03:11.711
"A clothing store up the street was just robbed."

66
00:03:12.412 --> 00:03:15.614
Fwoosh! A strong wind blew down the sidewalk outside.

67
00:03:16.275 --> 00:03:17.635
Papers fluttered through the air.

68
00:03:18.936 --> 00:03:20.037
Gem raised an eyebrow.

69
00:03:20.057 --> 00:03:23.780
"Do you think that was—" "The thief!"

70
00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:24.760
Roxy said.

71
00:03:25.941 --> 00:03:27.442
Detective Smith put his phone away.

72
00:03:27.462 --> 00:03:29.184
"Okay, Rocket Girl.

73
00:03:29.204 --> 00:03:31.622
We should Rocket Girl?"
